    <p style="	text-align: center;
">You&#39;ll find downloadable digital resources, videos on earthquakes and more at <a href="https://www.redcross.org/get-help/how-to-prepare-for-emergencies/teaching-kids-about-emergency-preparedness.html"><b>redcross.org/youthprep</b></a><span style="	font-size: 16.0px;
