            <div class="card-info">
                <div class="title">How Does the Red Cross Help During an Earthquake? </div>
                
                
                <div class="description text"><p>When an earthquake occurs, the Red Cross provides shelter, food and comfort. </p>
</div>
                <div class="cta-button">

<div class="redcross-button left" data-context="redcross-button">
    
